emscripten without pthreads: a single domain.

Domain.spawn cannot start a thread, while the runtime reserves the minor
heaps of all the possible domains at startup, which emscripten's mmap
allocates and clears: 16 MB in wasm32, 256 MB in wasm64.

--- a/runtime/caml/domain.h
+++ b/runtime/caml/domain.h
@@
-#ifdef ARCH_SIXTYFOUR
+#if defined(__EMSCRIPTEN__) && !defined(__EMSCRIPTEN_PTHREADS__)
+#define Max_domains 1
+#elif defined(ARCH_SIXTYFOUR)
 #define Max_domains 128
